# Ticket-verification screenshots. CONTRIBUTING.md puts screenshots in the documentation archive,
# not here, but they land at the repo root and otherwise sit in `git status` indefinitely — one
# `git add -A` away from being committed. Anchored to the root so frontend/acra_logo.png is
# unaffected.
/*.png

# Validation harness output (scripts/validation-run.sh)
validation-evidence/

# Ticket plan files (plans/plan_ticket_N.md) are review scratch space, deleted once a ticket
# ships — see CONTRIBUTING.md. Files already committed before this rule (plans/plan_ticket_*.md,
# plans/plan_a8_a10_readiness.md) are unaffected: an ignore rule never untracks a tracked file.
plans/

# Playwright (e2e specs are tracked; run output is not)
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/blob-report/
.playwright-mcp/
